{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/9cf7587c015e896b76942ceeac98c88e.avif?t=1758630363\" width=1178 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO is OUT!</strong><br><strong>Play it!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Giant`s Heart</strong> is a roguelike dungeon crawler with <strong>gardening</strong> elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/3ec0f79255f58f8f8a9f22e5b99b2d12.poster.avif?t=1758630363\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/3ec0f79255f58f8f8a9f22e5b99b2d12.webm?t=1758630363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/3ec0f79255f58f8f8a9f22e5b99b2d12.mp4?t=1758630363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESTROY THE HEART</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass through 3 unique biomes and reach the heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/05d75c704e94e0bcc5553e5c05236a2f.poster.avif?t=1758630363\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/05d75c704e94e0bcc5553e5c05236a2f.webm?t=1758630363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/05d75c704e94e0bcc5553e5c05236a2f.mp4?t=1758630363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your backpack with artifacts and create the strongest and fastest build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials and plant seeds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW A GARDEN - BECOME STRONGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between expeditions, grow plants - they make you stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/013283652bf7ce48b3cee6479cc5f109.poster.avif?t=1758630363\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/013283652bf7ce48b3cee6479cc5f109.webm?t=1758630363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/013283652bf7ce48b3cee6479cc5f109.mp4?t=1758630363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new weapons and upgrade old ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/f78cc83f6ca4d1df74c3cde5d3464e1a.poster.avif?t=1758630363\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/f78cc83f6ca4d1df74c3cde5d3464e1a.webm?t=1758630363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/f78cc83f6ca4d1df74c3cde5d3464e1a.mp4?t=1758630363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME IS THE MAIN CURRENCY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make critical decisions where the main stake is time - a currency more valuable than gold and artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mut